---
layout: base.njk
permalink: index.html
title: "ムートン — Personal Archive"
description: "ムートンの個人的な制作と記録の場所。哲学・生き方、身体、食事と科学についての記事と、おすすめの本。"
bodyClass: site
extraCss: [home.css]
preloadHero: true
---
<a class="skip" href="#journal">記事一覧へスキップ</a>
{% include "partials/nav.njk" %}

<main>
  <section class="scene scene-hero" id="top" data-scene data-next-overlap data-nav="dark">
    <div class="scene-pin">
      <div class="scene-media ph-hero{{ '' if (["images/hero.jpg"] | firstImage) else ' is-placeholder' }}"{% bgImage "images/hero.jpg" %}></div>
      <div class="scene-shade"></div>
      <div class="scene-copy" style="--y:center;--x:center;--w:1100px;text-align:center">
        <p class="eyebrow reveal">A personal archive for things yet to come</p>
        <h1 class="display reveal"><span class="nowrap">作る。</span><span class="nowrap">記録する。</span><br><span class="nowrap">残していく。</span></h1>
        <p class="lede reveal-2">考えたこと。作ったもの。変わっていく自分。<br>その途中を、静かに残していく。</p>
        <button class="hero-quiz reveal-2" type="button" data-qloop-open><span class="hero-quiz-mark" aria-hidden="true">○×</span>1問だけ、解いてみる</button>
        {%- for a in collections.articles %}{% if loop.first %}
        <a class="hero-latest reveal-2" href="{{ a.page.fileSlug }}.html"><span class="hero-latest-label">New</span><span class="hero-latest-title">{{ a.data.journal.title if a.data.journal else a.data.headline }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
        <p class="hero-links reveal-2"><a href="#guides">買う前に読む「選び方」 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="en/index.html" hreflang="en" lang="en">Read in English <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      </div>
      <a class="scroll-cue" href="#think">Scroll</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene overlap" id="think" data-scene data-reveal data-next-overlap data-nav="dark">
    <div class="scene-pin">
      <div class="scene-media ph-think{{ '' if (["images/scene-think.jpg"] | firstImage) else ' is-placeholder' }}"{% bgImage "images/scene-think.jpg" %}></div>
      <div class="scene-shade"></div>
      <div class="scene-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow reveal">01 — Philosophy</p>
        <h2 class="scene-title reveal">考える。</h2>
        <p class="scene-latin reveal">Meaning is not given; <em>it is left behind.</em></p>
        <p class="scene-text reveal-2">神は死んだ。それでも、なぜ生きるのか。自由、恐怖、セルフイメージ。答えを急がず、問いのまま残していく。</p>
        <a class="btn btn-light reveal-2" href="#journal" data-filter-link="philosophy">哲学・生き方の記事 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="scene-count" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene overlap" id="body" data-scene data-reveal data-next-overlap data-nav="light" data-tone="light">
    <div class="scene-pin">
      <div class="scene-media ph-body{{ '' if (["images/scene-body.jpg"] | firstImage) else ' is-placeholder' }}"{% bgImage "images/scene-body.jpg" %}></div>
      <div class="scene-shade"></div>
      <div class="scene-copy" style="--x:end;--y:center;--w:640px">
        <p class="eyebrow reveal">02 — Body</p>
        <h2 class="scene-title reveal">身体で、<br>確かめる。</h2>
        <p class="scene-latin reveal">Measured, <em>not imagined.</em></p>
        <p class="scene-text reveal-2">体力、血糖値、匂い、口臭。なんとなくの感覚を、研究とデータでもう一度確かめ直す。</p>
        <a class="btn btn-dark reveal-2" href="#journal" data-filter-link="body">身体の記事 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="scene-count" aria-hidden="true" style="right:auto;left:var(--gutter)">02</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene overlap" id="food" data-scene data-reveal data-nav="dark" style="--h:330vh">
    <div class="scene-pin">
      <div class="scene-media ph-food{{ '' if (["images/scene-food.jpg"] | firstImage) else ' is-placeholder' }}"{% bgImage "images/scene-food.jpg" %}></div>
      <div class="scene-shade"></div>
      <div class="scene-copy" style="--y:center;--x:center;--w:900px;text-align:center">
        <p class="eyebrow reveal">03 — Food &amp; Science</p>
        <h2 class="scene-title reveal">食べることを、<em>evidence</em>で。</h2>
        <p class="scene-text reveal-2" style="margin-inline:auto">ダークチョコ、オリーブ油、ブルーベリー。健康についての言葉を、論文とデータから確かめる。</p>
        <a class="btn btn-light reveal-2" href="#foodscience">食事・化学を読む <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="scene-count" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="guides" data-nav="light" data-nav-solid="light" aria-labelledby="guides-heading">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-head" data-rise>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Guides</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="guides-heading">選び方<em>— before you buy</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="copy">買う前に、何を見ればいいのか。記事で調べたことを、選ぶときの目安にまとめています。</p>
      </div>
      <p class="section-more section-more-dark"><a href="guides.html">選び方の記事をすべて見る <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      <div class="guide-grid">
        {%- for a in collections.articles | guideCards | head(6) %}
        <a class="guide-card" data-rise href="{{ a.page.fileSlug }}.html"><span class="guide-tag">{{ a.data.guide.tag }}</span><h3>{{ a.data.guide.title }}</h3><p>{{ a.data.guide.text }}</p><span class="guide-more">約{{ a.data.readMinutes }}分で読む →</span></a>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="journal" data-nav="light" data-nav-solid="light" aria-labelledby="journal-heading">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-head" data-rise>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Journal</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="journal-heading">記事<em>— notes in progress</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="copy">思ったこと、気づいたこと、迷ったこと、嬉しかったこと。完成した答えより、途中に残ったものを記録する。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="journal-tools">
        <div class="journal-filters" role="group" aria-label="記事のカテゴリー">
          <button class="journal-filter active" type="button" data-journal-filter="all">すべて</button>
          <button class="journal-filter" type="button" data-journal-filter="body">身体</button>
          <button class="journal-filter" type="button" data-journal-filter="philosophy">哲学・生き方</button>
          <button class="journal-filter" type="button" data-journal-filter="work">仕事・働き方</button>
          <button class="journal-filter" type="button" data-journal-filter="making">制作</button>
        </div>
        <div class="journal-search">
          <label for="journal-search-input">記事を検索</label>
          <input id="journal-search-input" type="search" placeholder="記事を検索（例：血糖、自由、匂い）" autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="search">
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="journal-search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <nav class="topic-links" aria-label="テーマ別のページ"><span>テーマ別に読む</span>{%- for t in topics %}<a href="topic-{{ t.key }}.html">{{ t.label }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>{% endfor %}</nav>
      <p class="read-progress" data-total="{{ collections.articles.length }}" hidden><span class="read-progress-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span><span class="read-progress-text"></span></p>
      <div class="lucky" data-lucky><button class="lucky-btn" type="button">どれを読むか迷ったら、おまかせで1本 <span aria-hidden="true">?</span></button><div class="lucky-out" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
      <div class="journal-list">
        {%- for a in collections.articles %}{% if a.data.journal %}
        <a class="journal-item clickable journal-link" data-rise href="{{ a.page.fileSlug }}.html" data-category="{{ a.data.journal.category }}">
          <div class="journal-date">{{ a.page.date | dotDate }}</div><div class="journal-dot"></div>
          <div class="journal-body"><div class="journal-title">{{ a.data.journal.title }}</div><div class="journal-excerpt">{{ a.data.journal.excerpt }}</div><span class="journal-read-time">約{{ a.data.readMinutes }}分</span></div>
          <div class="journal-arrow">→</div>
        </a>
        {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
        {%- for n in notes %}
        <div class="journal-item is-note" data-rise data-category="{{ n.category }}">
          <div class="journal-date">{{ n.date | dotDate }}</div><div class="journal-dot"></div>
          <div class="journal-body"><div class="journal-title">{{ n.title }}</div><div class="journal-excerpt">{{ n.excerpt }}</div></div>
          <div class="journal-arrow">—</div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-blue" id="foodscience" data-nav="dark" data-nav-solid="dark" aria-labelledby="foodscience-heading">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-head" data-rise>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Food &amp; Science</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="foodscience-heading">食事・化学<em>— read the evidence</em></h2>
        </div>
